# Labs, Engram looks, merge

## Labs
Routes and folders used to rehearse (`app/raton`, `app/x-flame`, mouse prototypes, `components/previews/**`) are **on purpose**. They exist to later merge into home. Do not treat them as accidental drift. Do not pressure cleanup unless the human asks.

## Engram = memory of what already looks right
This project improvises visually. Engram/Gentle holds what must survive across chats — not a product roadmap.

- Session start: `mem_context` (this repo).
- When the human likes a look or locks a constraint: `mem_save` (title + what/why/where).
- Before editing home: read Engram and honor **Do not regress** items.
- No beat/scene roadmap documents unless the human asks later.

## Merge lab → home
Ask clarifying questions before merge home / new lab route if ambiguous.
On “pasalo al home” / “implementalo en el home” / equivalent:
1. Integrate the approved lab behavior/assets into home.
2. Do not rewrite the whole splash.
3. Leave lab routes in place unless told to remove them.
